                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.2315/175: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Poindexter</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-02-28T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 28,
                                1925—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>9. Section 1. My 8, February 28, 3 p.m. [<hi rendition="#italic">a.m.</hi>]
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs assures me instructions will be cabled Velarde
                    before 1 p.m. today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Poindexter</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
